  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
  Utilities                                                                     
  No desktop theme switch is available here: switching needs a GNOME, KDE       
  Plasma or macOS session with the theme tool on PATH, and this host has none.  
  Change the dotfiles theme opens the list of complete themes; each names the   
  tools it cannot paint, and a theme is applied only when one is chosen there.  
  WSL resources are not adjustable here: .wslconfig is a Windows file read      
  only by WSL, and Linux does not run it. The utility is offered only on a WSL  
  host.                                                                         
  Measure the shell's startup runs zsh -i -c exit several times and reports     
  the median with the range; it changes nothing.                                
  Report the terminal capabilities reads the colour depth, OSC 52,              
  synchronized output and the Nerd Font glyphs, and names the source of every   
  answer.                                                                       
                                                                                
